      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Patient</span><span class=\"futura-bold\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">identification &amp;&nbsp;education</span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Does your practice offer the mild<sup>®</sup> procedure? Do you manage patient identification and education? If so, this blog offers practical guidance to help you confidently identify appropriate patients and educate them throughout the mild procedure journey.</span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Feb 18 2026 13:54:08 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
